nctionality.\n  - The code follows basic Java naming conventions, with class names in CamelCase and variable names in camelCase.\n- **Efficiency**: \n  - Since the `AIsearch` function call is commented out, it's hard to evaluate the efficiency of the code related to that operation. However, creating empty `ArrayLists` for `searchDomainFilter` and `resourceTypeFilter` when they might not be used (if the `AIsearch` function has default behavior for these parameters) might be a minor waste of resources.\n  - The `ResourceType` class is simple and doesn't seem to have any efficiency issues.\n- **Edge Cases**: \n  - The code doesn't handle any potential exceptions that might occur during the `AIsearch` function call, such as `NullPointerException` if the `AIsearch` implementation has some strict null - checking for its parameters.\n  - There's no validation for the `top_k` value in the `ResourceType` constructor to ensure it's within the valid range (1 - 10 as per the `AIsearch` function's description).\n- **Best Practices**: \n  - The code could benefit from using more meaningful constants instead of hard - coding values like `1e-10f` for `temperature` and `top_p`.\n  - Error handling should be added around the `AIsearch` function call once it's uncommented and the method is properly implemented.\n  - The code should consider adding JavaDoc comments to the `ResourceType` class and its methods for better code documentation. ","```java\nimport java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.List;\n\n/**\n * 该类用于模拟调用AIsearch函数进行动物识别和描述的操作。\n */\nclass Main {\n    // 定义温度和top_p的默认常量值\n    private static final float DEFAULT_TEMPERATURE = 1e-10f;\n    private static final float DEFAULT_TOP_P = 1e-10f;\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        // 搜索查询关键词，用于指定需要搜索的内容，这里是识别图片中的动物并用一句话描述\n        String query = \"识别图片中的动物并用一句话描述\";\n        // 用于控制搜索结果输出风格和格式的指令参数，这里要求以简洁的语句描述动物\n        String instruction = \"以简洁的语句描述动物\";\n        // 指定是否使用大语言模型对搜索结果进行总结，以及使用哪个模型进行总结，这里为null表示直接返回原始搜索结果\n        String model = null;\n        // 控制模型输出随机性的采样参数，取值范围为(0, 1]，仅在model参数指定了LLM模型时生效\n        float temperature = DEFAULT_TEMPERATURE;\n        // 控制模型输出多样性的核采样参数，默认值为1e-10，仅在model参数指定了LLM模型时生效\n        float top_p = DEFAULT_TOP_P;\n        // 搜索领域过滤器，这里创建了空列表，可能在实际需求中会添加过滤内容\n        List<String> searchDomainFilter = new ArrayList<>();\n        // 搜索资源类型过滤器，指定搜索资源的类型和每种类型返回的结果数量\n        List<ResourceType> resourceTypeFilter = new ArrayList<>();\n        try {\n            // 添加一个网页类型的资源过滤条件，最多返回10条结果\n            resourceTypeFilter.add(new ResourceType(\"web\", 10));\n        } catch (IllegalArgumentException e) {\n            System.err.println(\"Invalid top_k value in ResourceType constructor: \" + e.getMessage());\n        }\n\n        try {\n            // 调用AIsearch函数进行动物识别和描述\n            AIsearch(query, instruction, model, temperature, top_p, searchDomainFilter, resourceTypeFilter);\n        } catch (Exception e) {\n            System.err.println(\"An error occurred during AIsearch: \" + e.getMessage());\n        }\n        System.out.println(\"模拟调用AIsearch函数进行动物识别和描述\");\n    }\n}\n\n/**\n * 该类用于表示搜索资源的类型和每种类型返回的结果数量。\n */\nclass ResourceType {\n    private String type;\n    private int top_k;\n\n    /**\n     * 构造函数，用于创建一个ResourceType对象。\n     *\n     * @param type  资源类型，如\"web\"、\"image\"、\"video\"等\n     * @param top_k 每种资源类型返回的结果数量，取值范围为1 - 10\n     * @throws IllegalArgumentException 如果top_k不在有效范围内（1 - 10），则抛出此异常\n     */\n    public ResourceType(String type, int top_k) {\n        if (top_k < 1 || top_k > 10) {\n            throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"top_k value must be between 1 and 10\");\n        }\n        this.type = type;\n        this.top_k = top_k;\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 获取资源类型。\n     *\n     * @return 资源类型字符串\n     */\n    public String getType() {\n        return type;\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 获取每种资源类型返回的结果数量。\n     *\n     * @return top_k值\n     */\n    public int getTop_k() {\n        return top_k;\n    }\n}\n```"]
